      "entryId": "t_adde034233ba",
      "sourceTerm": "即心是佛",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 1,
      "relPath": "J/J38/J38nB408.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "大梅云：「任他非心非佛，我只即心即佛。」"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
      "entryId": "t_adde034233ba",
      "sourceTerm": "即心是佛",
      "senseIndex": 1,
      "occurrenceIndex": 2,
      "relPath": "J/J28/J28nB211.xml",
      "kind": "headword-free-kwic",
      "kwic": "南泉示眾云：「馬大師說即心即佛。王老師不恁麼道，不是心，不是佛，不是物。恁麼道還有過麼？」趙州禮拜"
    },
    {
      "origin": "termbase",
